This sample does not vendor third-party code in the repository. Building and
deploying it downloads the components listed below. Each is used under its own
license; review the license terms before use.

** openvscode-server v1.109.5 - https://github.com/gitpod-io/openvscode-server
   Downloaded during the MicroVM image build (microvm/Dockerfile), pinned by SHA-256.
   License: MIT - https://github.com/gitpod-io/openvscode-server/blob/main/LICENSE.txt

** AWS Lambda MicroVMs base image public.ecr.aws/lambda/microvms:al2023-minimal
   Used as the MicroVM image base (microvm/Dockerfile).
   License: see the image and Amazon Linux 2023 package licenses.

** git, python3, tar, gzip, shadow-utils, hostname, procps-ng, which, less
   Installed from the Amazon Linux 2023 package repositories (microvm/Dockerfile).
   License: various, per package (see `dnf info <package>` in the image).

** aws-cdk-lib - https://github.com/aws/aws-cdk
   Python dependency (pyproject.toml, pinned in uv.lock).
   License: Apache-2.0 - https://github.com/aws/aws-cdk/blob/main/LICENSE

** constructs - https://github.com/aws/constructs
   Python dependency (pyproject.toml, pinned in uv.lock).
   License: Apache-2.0 - https://github.com/aws/constructs/blob/10.x/LICENSE

** Transitive Python dependencies of aws-cdk-lib and constructs
   Installed by `uv sync` (pinned in uv.lock).
   - jsii, aws-cdk.asset-awscli-v1, aws-cdk.asset-node-proxy-agent-v6,
     aws-cdk.cloud-assembly-schema - License: Apache-2.0 - https://github.com/aws/jsii, https://github.com/cdklabs
   - tzdata - License: Apache-2.0 - https://github.com/python/tzdata
   - attrs, cattrs - License: MIT - https://github.com/python-attrs
   - publication - License: MIT - https://github.com/glyph/publication
   - typeguard - License: MIT - https://github.com/agronholm/typeguard
   - python-dateutil - License: BSD-3-Clause (dual Apache-2.0) - https://github.com/dateutil/dateutil
   - typing_extensions - License: PSF-2.0 - https://github.com/python/typing_extensions
   - six - License: MIT - https://github.com/benjaminp/six
   - exceptiongroup (Python 3.10 only) - License: MIT - https://github.com/agronholm/exceptiongroup

** AWS CDK CLI (aws-cdk, npm) - https://github.com/aws/aws-cdk-cli
   Used to deploy the stack.
   License: Apache-2.0 - https://github.com/aws/aws-cdk-cli/blob/main/LICENSE

** boto3 / botocore - https://github.com/boto/boto3
   Provided by the AWS Lambda Python runtime for the session function; not installed by this sample.
   License: Apache-2.0 - https://github.com/boto/boto3/blob/develop/LICENSE

VS Code extensions that users install inside their MicroVM come from the
